sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant Meta as Metadata service
    participant Blob as Blob store
    participant CDN as CDN
    participant Peer as Other device
    Cl->>Cl: chunk the file, hash each chunk
    Cl->>Meta: which of these chunk hashes do you already have?
    Meta-->>Cl: the missing ones only
    Note over Cl,Meta: deduplication — an unchanged chunk is never re-uploaded
    Meta-->>Cl: presigned upload URLs
    Cl->>Blob: PUT chunks directly
    Note over Cl,Blob: bytes bypass the application tier entirely
    Cl->>Meta: commit the new file version
    Meta->>Peer: notify of the change
    Peer->>Meta: fetch the manifest
    Meta-->>Peer: presigned download URLs
    Peer->>CDN: GET chunks
    CDN-->>Peer: cached at the edge
